# The three app unions and their arms are ruby/codegen/generate.rb's, not
# openapi-generator's (ADR 30.9.26am D6). One glob per union covers the union
# file and every `<union>_<tag>` arm file. The leading `**/` is the pin's
# price: it matches the root-relative lib/lingara-apps/models/<file>.
# generate.rb refuses a models directory holding any of these names, so a
# fourth union this file does not name fails codegen-ruby.
**/models/card_element*.rb
**/models/list_item*.rb
**/models/context_slice*.rb
